#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-nora-overview.rst:87
#: e2aec4936ed94923ac59a17b58b88e45
msgid "All motor/servo outputs are DShot and PWM capable. However, mixing DShot and normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling DShot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be configured and used as DShot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups that must be the same (PWM rate or DShot, when configured as a normal servo/motor output) are: 1-4, 5-8,and 9-12. Outputs 13 and 14 are not DShot capable."
msgstr ""

